## Notes / judgment calls

- Implementation is pure-function only (`validateWhitespaceRules`, `applyAiRound`,
  `rollbackAiRound`, `isAvaAuthored`, `hashContent`) per issue #291 guidance
  ("留白校验器是纯函数（Node 单测），回滚是事务性写"). No Postgres-backed wiring was
  added in this pass — the UI (`canvas-ai-changes`/`canvas-ai-rollback`/
  `canvas-ai-mode-toggle`) already existed prior to this feature (per issue notes)
  and is unmodified.
- Dependencies F103 and F93 are listed `in_progress`/not-ready in feature_list.json.
  This feature's contract surface (`SectionDef`/`WhitespaceWarning` from
  `packages/contracts/src/canvas.ts`) does not require F103's finalized markdown
  serialization format; the markdown sticky/citation notation used by
  `validateWhitespaceRules` is explicitly documented in the file header as a
  transitional notation pending F103, not a redefinition of its contract.
- `tsc --noEmit -p .` on `apps/api` fails, but only on pre-existing
  `packages/fabric-markdown/src/{fabric-objects,mermaid-parser}.ts` DOM-lib errors
  unrelated to this diff (confirmed present on `origin/main` HEAD before any F106
  change was applied).
- `apps/api/tests/contract-single-source.test.ts` passes — no contract types are
  redefined in the backend.
